{"ID":"20250926153348-m04qffc","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250926153348-m04qffc","title":"UPL7-2——时间步长和最大允许时间步长","type":"doc","updated":"20251031143600"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926153348-pwmimnt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250926153348-pwmimnt","updated":"20250926200505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 物理系统中的更新机制"}]},{"ID":"20250926200012-u4ig3te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200012-u4ig3te","updated":"20250926200044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 中的 3D 物理系统基于 Nvidia（英伟达）的 PhysX，2D 物理系统基于开源项目 Box2D\nUnity中 对他们进行了封装，我们不需要知道内部是如何执行的，只要调用 Unity 相关API，既可以让两个物理引擎解决方案以相同的方式运行"}]},{"ID":"20250926200049-bxcl0ga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200049-bxcl0ga","updated":"20250926200126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理系统的执行机制中，最重要的就是 时间步长(Time Step) 的概念\n时间步长在 Unity 中我们一般称为 固定更新时间步长，指的是 物理世界 更新的固定时间间隔\n即每隔多长时间更新一次物理逻辑，在 Unity 中默认为每 20 ms(即 0.02 秒，50 Hz) 更新一次\n我们可以在 Project Settings ——\u003e Time ——\u003e Fixed Timestep 中进行设置"}]},{"ID":"20250926200128-7514m6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200128-7514m6w","updated":"20250926200233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 726px;","style":"width: 716px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240321162616-5wjffa4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 716px;\" parent-style=\"width: 726px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250926200116-j5fajwm","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250926200116-j5fajwm","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250926200342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250926200256-z6uug3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200256-z6uug3s","updated":"20250926200256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："}]},{"ID":"20250926200304-7ltuqys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200304-7ltuqys","updated":"20250926200309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理逻辑是独立于帧率的，不以帧为准，而是严格以固定时间步长为准，一帧里可能执行 0 次、1 次、甚至多次物理循环\n即 如果固定时间步长小于实际帧更新耗时，那么在一帧中可能会发生不止一次物理循环更新"}]},{"ID":"20250926200314-op71nfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200314-op71nfk","updated":"20250926200323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20250926200323-cknxpns","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250926200323-cknxpns","updated":"20250926200342"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926200323-26cwid7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250926200323-26cwid7","updated":"20250926200330"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926200323-rb1k01o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200323-rb1k01o","updated":"20250926200330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏比较流畅，一帧只跑了 15 ms，那么该帧中物理更新可能不需要执行和更新"}]}]},{"ID":"20250926200323-3yotlrd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250926200323-3yotlrd","updated":"20250926200342"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926200323-802inml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200323-802inml","updated":"20250926200342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏比较卡顿，一帧跑了 40 ms，那么该帧中物理更新需要连续执行 2 次"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250926200321-ntnzais","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200321-ntnzais","updated":"20250926200321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也就说，物理更新只以实际经过的时间为准，间隔时间到了固定时间步长就必须更新一次的规则\n如果真间隔时间过长，在执行物理逻辑时，必须补满对应执行次数"}]}]},{"ID":"20250926200252-zp8kvmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200252-zp8kvmy","updated":"20250926200401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是如果掉帧太严重，会丢弃部分时间片，避免无限补帧，可以自己设置丢弃的时间上限\nProject Setting ——\u003e Time ——\u003e Maximum Allowed Timestep（最大允许时间步长）进行设置"}]},{"ID":"20250926200403-70pvms3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200403-70pvms3","updated":"20250926200454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250926200454-v76upd8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250926200505-c2sdgzu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250926200505-c2sdgzu","updated":"20250926200554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低物理步频"}]},{"ID":"20250926200511-n28lz03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200511-n28lz03","updated":"20250926200554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从知识回顾我们得知，时间步长其实就决定了在单位时间中物理系统更新的频率\n因此，我们可以根据需求，通过提高：Project Settings ——\u003e Time ——\u003e Fixed Timestep\n固定时间步长的值来降低物理系统开销，相当于减少物理系统更新次数\n但是我们需要进行表现性的权衡，即较高的间隔时间，是否会带来物理系统稳定性与穿透的风险上升，影响我们的表现"}]},{"ID":"20250926200549-mv7wbfm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250926200549-mv7wbfm","updated":"20251031143600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谨慎修改最大允许时间步长"}]},{"ID":"20250926200611-guu1ywk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200611-guu1ywk","updated":"20250926200618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Maximum Allowed Timestep（最大允许时间步长）是用于防止游戏在非常卡顿时，造成不停地补物理帧的情况\n超过最大允许时间步长的时间会被直接丢弃"}]},{"ID":"20250926200622-6uyklnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200622-6uyklnd","updated":"20250926200750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例：\n假设 最大允许时间步长 默认值为 0.333 s（333 ms），如果真的卡顿造成帧间隔时间超过这个时间，比如为 0.5 s（500 ms）\n那么该帧最多也就补 16 次物理更新逻辑，超过的时间会直接丢弃，不会进行更多次的物理更新了"}]},{"ID":"20250926200611-l29rnvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200611-l29rnvu","updated":"20250926200647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果想要通过改小它来优化性能：比如从 0.333 s 改成 0.1 s，需要注意"}]},{"ID":"20250926200647-kkodftu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250926200647-kkodftu","updated":"20251031143600"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926200647-5cggubk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250926200647-5cggubk","updated":"20250926205523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926200647-t0repk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200647-t0repk6","updated":"20250926200647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高帧率时"}]},{"ID":"20250926200647-u575bug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200647-u575bug","updated":"20250926205523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按 Fixed Timestep（物理更新步长）正常算，Maximum Allowed Timestep (最大允许时间步长）不会触发"}]}]},{"ID":"20250926200647-f4jm7c5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250926200647-f4jm7c5","updated":"20251031143600"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926200647-efu93x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200647-efu93x2","updated":"20250926200647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"低帧率时"}]},{"ID":"20250926200650-vhox0cx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200650-vhox0cx","updated":"20251031143600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假设某帧掉到 0.2s，如果不修改，Unity 会补 10 个物理更新，如果修改，Unity 最多补 5 个物理更新，剩下 0.1s 的物理更新直接丢弃\n虽然看起来，少了一些物理计算，但是从表现上来看，物理对象可能出现瞬移或者跳跃等奇怪表现"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250926200611-jcst3x0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200611-jcst3x0","updated":"20250926200713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此通过改小 Maximum Allowed Timestep（最大允许时间步长），\n虽然 CPU 会少计算物理更新，看起来是减小了消耗，但是会牺牲物理表现的连续性，强行降低了物理精度！"}]},{"ID":"20250926200816-fnp844v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926200816-fnp844v","updated":"20250926200816"}}]}